--
inconsistent return
--
The assertions VERIFY (sound havoc), but the disallowed pattern pins
that char_traits::to_int_type / basic_string::find / allocator::
allocate et al. are DEMOTED ("inconsistent return ... body is
dropped") because inner recoveries under the system-header guard
print errors without throwing, leaving half-type-checked bodies.
Fix arc: make each such site throw to the body-level recovery or
recover to a type-consistent node (see findings log, rounds 36-37);
then flip this to CORE.  2026-08-12.
